        "name": "Cristiano Giovando",
        "url": "https://geonode.resilienceacademy.ac.tz"
      },
      "purpose": "Purpose of this data set is to understand the effects of yearly floodings to the local residents living near Msimbazi river banks and nearby flood-prone areas. This data set can be used in all purposes from community development to research and education..",
